  "tip_es": "When a weak vowel (i, u) joins a strong vowel (a, e, o), they make one syllable: cuatro, siete, aire. Say them in one beat, gliding from one to the other. Two strong vowels (a, e, o) stay in separate syllables: teatro (te-A-tro).",
